{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Liminal urbanism is a single-player game, a solo project with a unique idea of combining\u00a0the nostalgic and eerie feeling of liminal spaces with cityscapes and landscapes. The game consists of 4 Major levels with a twisted entity roaming the cityscapes. In every update a new level entry will be added with each update until i give the best experience of Liminal Urbanism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3418920?t=1740669230","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3418920?t=1740669230","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418920/8d2ffba2e27d642610745d62ca8fc23731a04360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740669230","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418920/8d2ffba2e27d642610745d62ca8fc23731a04360/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740669230","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Frequent Jumpscares"},"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418920/extras/ABOUT_LIMINAL_2.png?t=1740669230\" />\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>New twist in Liminal Spaces</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore surreal and unsettling environments that blur the line between reality and nightmare, inspired by liminal aesthetics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Atmospheric Horror</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel the unease of the 1990s-inspired setting with haunting visuals and creppy ambient sounds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>High Replay Value</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedural elements and unpredictable monster behavior make every playthrough unique.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Twisted entity AI</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Creppy and unpredictable movements based on random waypoints/sound detection AI.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Liminal urbanism is a single-player game, a solo project with a unique idea of combining\u00a0the nostalgic and eerie feeling of liminal spaces with cityscapes and landscapes. The game consists of 4 Major levels with a twisted entity roaming the cityscapes. In every update a new level entry will be added with each update until i give the best experience of Liminal Urbanism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Filios Christou"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418920/header.jpg?t=1740669230","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<strong>\u00a9 2025 Filios Christou. All rights reserved.</strong>","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257107947,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107947/movie480.mp4?t=1740669228","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107947/movie_max.mp4?t=1740669228"},"name":"Liminal Urbanism Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257107947/38da2e0fbafeff5551b9b2e8ca67a14770c2890f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740669228","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107947/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740669228","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic